How packages were installed:

conda create -y -n LOSDT_test python=3.12
conda activate LOSDT_test
conda install --yes -c conda-forge openmmforcefields openmm openff-toolkit pdbfixer xtb==6.6 mkl==2024.0
pip install admet-ai==1.3.1 pdb-tools streamlit==1.51.0 streamlit-ketcher streamlit-molstar open3d
pip install rdkit==2024.9.4 scipy==1.15.0 torch==2.3.1 setuptools==75.1.0 matplotlib==3.10.0

git clone dimorphote_dl and install in third party software folder. Replace substructure.smarts file with one from hiqbind
